.DS_Store

# Note: retrieved PDFs are ignored by lit/.gitignore, next to what they govern.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
# results/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The tables are small (~1 KB) and fully
# reproducible from chronology.md and geography.md via scripts/build_tables.py,
# which argues for ignoring them. Committing wins on a different ground: the diff
# shows when a date changed and what it did to a duration, and this project is
# about provenance. Regenerate rather than hand-edit.
